{"id":"2e80fbecaa53ce67","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-randomized-reduction.md","title":"随机多项式时间多一归约","display":"df-randomized-reduction — 随机多项式时间多一归约","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-randomized-reduction","aliases":["28-df-randomized-reduction"],"display":"df-randomized-reduction — 随机多项式时间多一归约","depends_on":["[[28-df-ppt]]","[[28-df-characteristic-language]]"],"source_reference":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach; Definition 7.16; orientation corrected from context","source_printed_pages":"138","source_pdf_pages":"164","source_status":"statement-compared-local-formalization","source_statement_verified":true,"source_proof_reviewed":false,"eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-randomized-reduction"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-randomized-reduction</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-randomized-reduction — 随机多项式时间多一归约"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b75200f005282ddf\" href=\"?note=b75200f005282ddf\" title=\"28-df-ppt\">28-df-ppt</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f982c99aef3f369e\" href=\"?note=f982c99aef3f369e\" title=\"28-df-characteristic-language\">28-df-characteristic-language</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach; Definition 7.16; orientation corrected from context"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"138"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"164"},{"key":"source_status","html":"statement-compared-local-formalization"},{"key":"source_statement_verified","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B,C\\subseteq\\Sigma^*\">\\(B,C\\subseteq\\Sigma^*\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{PPT}\">\\(\\mathbf{PPT}\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b75200f005282ddf\" href=\"?note=b75200f005282ddf\" title=\"28-df-ppt\">28-df-ppt</a> 的多项式时间随机字符串输出算法；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi_B,\\chi_C\">\\(\\chi_B,\\chi_C\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"f982c99aef3f369e\" href=\"?note=f982c99aef3f369e\" title=\"28-df-characteristic-language\">28-df-characteristic-language</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"B\\le_r C\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists A\\in\\mathbf{PPT}\\;\\forall x\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\\Pr[\\chi_C(A(x))=\\chi_B(x)]\\ge\\tfrac23.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[B\\le_r C\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists A\\in\\mathbf{PPT}\\;\\forall x\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\\Pr[\\chi_C(A(x))=\\chi_B(x)]\\ge\\tfrac23.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>算法把源B的输入x变为目标C的输入，成功表示目标答案等于源答案。所给PDF定义7.16写作B(M(x))=C(x)，与该段“B归约到C”及随后C∈BPP推出B∈BPP的上下文方向相反；这里明确校正为C(M(x))=B(x)，保留该来源差异，未声称逐字一致。固定2/3的单次映射归约不能直接由两次独立成功相乘证明传递性。</p>\n<p>来源：用户所给 Arora–Barak PDF，Definition 7.16; orientation corrected from context；印刷 pp.138 / PDF pp.164。本次核对范围：定义陈述与本地形式化。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-ppt","status":"resolved","id":"b75200f005282ddf","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-ppt]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-characteristic-language","status":"resolved","id":"f982c99aef3f369e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-characteristic-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-ppt","status":"resolved","id":"b75200f005282ddf","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$B,C\\subseteq\\Sigma^*$，$\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}$；$\\mathbf{PPT}$ 是 [[28-df-ppt]] 的多项式时间随机字符串输出算法；$\\chi_B,\\chi_C$ 见 [[28-df-characteristic-language]]。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-characteristic-language","status":"resolved","id":"f982c99aef3f369e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$B,C\\subseteq\\Sigma^*$，$\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}$；$\\mathbf{PPT}$ 是 [[28-df-ppt]] 的多项式时间随机字符串输出算法；$\\chi_B,\\chi_C$ 见 [[28-df-characteristic-language]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"B,C\\subseteq\\Sigma^*","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{PPT}","display":false},{"tex":"\\chi_B,\\chi_C","display":false},{"tex":"B\\le_r C\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists A\\in\\mathbf{PPT}\\;\\forall x\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\\Pr[\\chi_C(A(x))=\\chi_B(x)]\\ge\\tfrac23.","display":true}],"bytes":1637,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-301","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[28-df-bptime]]、[[28-df-randomized-reduction]]、[[28-prop-randomized-reduction-bpp-closure]]、[[28-lem-von-neumann-unbiasing]]、[[28-lem-computable-biased-coin]]、[[28-df-randomized-space-machine]]、[[28-df-bpl-rl]]。"},{"id":"c210338b489f6670","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$B,C\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^*$；$\\le_r$ 见 [[28-df-randomized-reduction]]；$\\mathbf{BPP}$ 见 [[28-df-bpp]]。"}],"outgoing":["b75200f005282ddf","f982c99aef3f369e"]}